    "detailed_description": "Enigma Manor is a 1-4 player co-op survival horror game. Navigate your way through the procedurally generated manor, fend off monsters, solve puzzles and find a way to escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306710/extras/b3d979112b51c3ba449af4435c2d4669.webp?t=1747925398\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Limited Resources:</strong> Scavenge the manor for ammunition and health items to protect yourself from the monsters that lie within, but use them wisely as resources are limited.<br></li><li> <strong>Puzzles:</strong> Collect keys around the area to unlock new rooms, find more items and get access to a variety of different puzzles. Solve these puzzles to get one step closer to escaping.<br></li><li> <strong>Hardcore:</strong> Getting out alive won't be easy, there are no checkpoints and no saves. You only get one chance to escape, and you'll receive a final rank based on your performance.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306710/extras/3d73070ba1539c9299a3db988ec5d91d.webp?t=1747925398\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rooms:</strong> The layout of the manor is procedurally generated each time, so players must learn how to navigate through the area as they play.<br></li><li> <strong>Items:</strong> Keys, resources and other such items are spawned in different locations of the map for every playthrough. Search rooms carefully for everything you need to survive.<br></li><li> <strong>Enemies:</strong> Monsters are randomly selected and spawned around the area, so you never know what might be waiting for you on the other side of a door.<br></li><li> <strong>Locks:</strong> Doors can be assigned with various different lock types, or even without a lock entirely. Remember which keys are required and only carry what is needed.<br></li><li> <strong>Puzzles:</strong> Puzzles are chosen at random and their solutions are changed each time, which makes problem solving necessary to escape.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306710/extras/a42818c3ae9d2ea1f8141b2e24064eab.webp?t=1747925398\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>4 Players:</strong> Play alone or with up to 3 other people, invite players to a private server only accessible to you and your friends.<br></li><li> <strong>Co-operative:</strong> Work together to escape and leave no one behind, share resources among each other to ensure everyone has a fighting chance.<br></li><li> <strong>Proximity Chat:</strong> Use the in-game proximity voice chat for the best experience, listen closely as your friends scream in the distance.</li></ul>",
